--- a/docs/locales/zh_CN/LC_MESSAGES/m5ui/index.po
+++ b/docs/locales/zh_CN/LC_MESSAGES/m5ui/index.po
@@ -541,3 +541,27 @@ msgid ""
 msgstr ""
 "请在调用 ``m5ui.init()`` 前设置屏幕旋转方向。更新 M5GFX 后，Core2、CoreS3 和 StackChan 的正常 320 "
 "× 240 横屏布局使用 ``0``。其他主机及旧工程的迁移方法见 :ref:`display-rotation`。"
+
+#: ../../source/m5ui/index.rst
+msgid ""
+"On M5Stack devices, ``m5ui.init()`` initializes the board, the display and "
+"LVGL."
+msgstr "在 M5Stack 设备上，``m5ui.init()`` 会初始化主机、显示屏和 LVGL。"
+
+#: ../../source/m5ui/index.rst
+msgid ""
+"To configure the display before LVGL is initialized, call ``M5.begin()``, "
+"set the desired rotation, and then call ``m5ui.init()``. With the updated "
+"M5GFX, Core2, CoreS3 and StackChan use ``0`` for their normal 320 × 240 "
+"landscape layout. See :ref:`display-rotation` for other controllers and "
+"migration instructions."
+msgstr ""
+"如需在 LVGL 初始化前配置显示屏，请先调用 ``M5.begin()``，设置所需旋转方向，再调用 ``m5ui.init()``。在更新后的 "
+"M5GFX 中，Core2、CoreS3 和 StackChan 的正常 320 × 240 横屏布局使用 ``0``。其它主机和迁移说明见 "
+":ref:`display-rotation`。"
+
+#: ../../source/m5ui/index.rst
+msgid ""
+"Initialize the M5UI library. On M5Stack devices this also initializes the "
+"board and display. Call this function before creating M5UI widgets."
+msgstr "初始化 M5UI 库。在 M5Stack 设备上，此函数还会初始化主机和显示屏。请在创建 M5UI 控件前调用此函数。"
diff --git a/docs/source/hardware/adc.rst b/docs/source/hardware/adc.rst
index 891a38c..6dc2d00 100644
--- a/docs/source/hardware/adc.rst
+++ b/docs/source/hardware/adc.rst
@@ -32,12 +32,25 @@ UIFLOW2 Example:
 class ADC
 ---------
 
-.. class:: ADC(pin, *, atten)
+Import the ADC and pin classes explicitly. The ``hardware`` namespace exports the same
+classes as ``machine``.
+
+.. code-block:: python
+
+    from hardware import ADC, Pin
+
+    adc = ADC(Pin(6))
+    adc_with_attenuation = ADC(Pin(6), atten=ADC.ATTN_11DB)
+
+.. class:: ADC(pin, *, atten=ADC.ATTN_11DB)
 
     Return the ADC object for the specified pin. ESP32 does not support
     different timings for ADC sampling and so the ``sample_ns`` keyword argument
     is not supported.
 
+    The ``atten`` keyword is optional and defaults to ``ADC.ATTN_11DB`` on the ESP32
+    port. Pass an attenuation constant explicitly to choose another setting.
+
     To read voltages above the reference voltage, apply input attenuation with
     the ``atten`` keyword argument. Valid values (and approximate linear
     measurement ranges) are:
@@ -62,15 +75,21 @@ Methods
     This method returns the raw ADC value ranged according to the resolution of
     the block, e.g., 0-4095 for 12-bit resolution.
 
+    :return: Raw ADC reading.
+    :rtype: int
+
     UIFLOW2:
 
         |read.png|
 
 .. method:: ADC.read_u16()
 
-   Take an analog reading and return an integer in the range 0-65535.
-   The return value represents the raw reading taken by the ADC, scaled
-   such that the minimum value is 0 and the maximum value is 65535.
+    Take an analog reading and return an integer in the range 0-65535.
+    The return value represents the raw reading taken by the ADC, scaled
+    such that the minimum value is 0 and the maximum value is 65535.
+
+    :return: Raw ADC reading scaled to 0-65535.
+    :rtype: int
 
     UIFLOW2:
 
@@ -88,6 +107,10 @@ Methods
     Within the linear range, however, more accurate and consistent results will
     be obtained than using `read_u16()` and scaling the result with a constant.
 
+    :return: Calibrated input voltage in microvolts.
+    :rtype: int
+    :raises OSError: If calibrated readings are unavailable on the port or chip.
+
     UIFLOW2:
 
         |read_uv.png|
